WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.850
- As much as I love New
York City at Christmas time,

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:06.058
'cause I really do, I also
look forward to spending time,

00:00:06.058 --> 00:00:08.850
like, even more so at my ranch in Montana.

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.080
I love it so much.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:11.310
It's just so beautiful.

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:12.660
And look, I grew up with nothing

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.760
and I finally got something
that is so magical,

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:16.830
and it's awesome and it's beautiful.

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:18.720
And that's why I'm really excited about

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:21.180
the new Montana collection
by Kelly Clarkson Home,

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.424
exclusively at Wayfair.

00:00:22.424 --> 00:00:23.865
(audience cheering)

00:00:23.865 --> 00:00:25.020
I was so inspired by Montana,

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.250
I wanted to create something

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.870
that I love how I decorate there.

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:29.640
It's a reflection of my sanctuary

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.890
with ranch-inspired looks
and heirloom appeal.

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:33.600
Plus, these pieces are affordable,

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.610
which is super cool, and
designed for real life

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:38.280
to enhance any space in your home.

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:40.110
Today we actually have
another Montana lover,

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:41.970
which I'm very excited about in the house.

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:44.280
She is up in our Wayfair VIP lounge,

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:46.350
which just got some
new furniture and decor

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:47.678
from the Montana collection.

00:00:47.678 --> 00:00:48.511
(audience cheering)

00:00:48.511 --> 00:00:49.800
- Everybody say hello to the host

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.670
of "The Mountain Kitchen" on
Magnolia Network, Annie Starke.

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:54.682
Give it up.

00:00:54.682 --> 00:00:57.766
(audience cheering)

00:00:57.766 --> 00:00:59.226
Oh my gosh.

00:00:59.226 --> 00:01:01.508
I love that you know my love of Montana.

00:01:01.508 --> 00:01:03.210
- Hi, neighbor, what's up?

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:04.170
- I love it there.

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:05.820
It's beautiful.
- Oh, me too.

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:06.870
- Yeah, do you just love,

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:08.520
you're getting to work
there now too, right?

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:10.110
- I am, I'm so lucky.

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:12.630
And my whole family on
my mom's side is there,

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:14.594
so you know, we all went rogue.

00:01:14.594 --> 00:01:15.470
It's great.

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:16.303
- It's so, you know why?

00:01:16.303 --> 00:01:17.136
'Cause it's so beautiful.

00:01:17.136 --> 00:01:19.650
I feel like it's like the
last unchartered place.

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:21.450
It's so beautiful.

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:22.283
So you have a new show.

00:01:22.283 --> 00:01:23.400
It's called "The Mountain Kitchen," right?

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:24.270
- I do.

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:25.103
- What, do you cook?

00:01:25.103 --> 00:01:26.010
Are you really good at cooking?

00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:27.990
- I, well, you know, I don't mean to brag.

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:28.823
- Okay.
(audience laughing)

00:01:28.823 --> 00:01:31.740
Do you like friends to come
over and test your food?

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:34.230
Because I don't cook, but I love eating.

00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:35.070
- I do.

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:37.472
I have friends, I have
my husband, you know.

00:01:37.472 --> 00:01:38.305
- Oh nice.

00:01:38.305 --> 00:01:40.770
- Yeah, I, you know, I'm a
big grandmother basically.

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:43.320
You come in my house, I
need to feed you something.

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:44.520
- Oh my God.
(Annie laughing)

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:46.740
I'm like that Stovetop
Kid commercial, you know,

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:48.510
that just shows up at your
door right at dinnertime.

00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:49.852
- Oh, that's weird. (laughs)

00:01:49.852 --> 00:01:51.517
- Oh, you're eating-
- Well, come on over

00:01:51.517 --> 00:01:52.655
for heaven's sake.
- Okay, sure, I'll come in.

00:01:52.655 --> 00:01:53.940
- Yeah, yeah.
- I love it.

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:55.110
Do you love your new show?

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:55.943
- I love it.

00:01:55.943 --> 00:01:57.900
It's so great, and, you know, it's such,

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:00.096
it's kind of a love letter
to Montana, you know?

00:02:00.096 --> 00:02:00.929
- Yeah.

00:02:00.929 --> 00:02:01.762
- Love letter to Bozeman and all that-

00:02:01.762 --> 00:02:02.820
- I mean, it's one thing to live there,

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:04.110
I think people don't realize like,

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:05.338
oh my God, is that where you live?

00:02:05.338 --> 00:02:06.250
- (laughs) Yeah.

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:07.830
And I love cooking with fire.

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:09.510
I always smell like smoke, honestly,

00:02:09.510 --> 00:02:10.720
which some people don't like.

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:11.596
I kind of love it.

00:02:11.596 --> 00:02:12.429
- I always smell like smoke

00:02:12.429 --> 00:02:13.350
'cause we have a fire going constantly.

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:14.183
I'm not cooking.

00:02:14.183 --> 00:02:15.537
I love that you do.

00:02:15.537 --> 00:02:17.895
Thank you, Annie, for joining us.

00:02:17.895 --> 00:02:20.393
(audience cheering)

00:02:20.393 --> 00:02:22.573
All right, y'all, you can
catch "The Mountain Kitchen"

00:02:22.573 --> 00:02:26.010
on Magnolia Network with
new episodes every Sunday

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:28.480
and streaming the same day
on Max and Discovery Plus.

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:31.050
I mean, hell, you just wanna
tune in just for the aesthetic.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.127
That place is gorgeous.

00:02:32.127 --> 00:02:34.770
And also remember to check
out the Montana collection

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:36.270
exclusively at Wayfair,

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:38.583
'cause I love Montana, so I was inspired.

